     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Dear all,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">I have been trying to\r\nspecify with lavaan a model which contains a combination of ordinal and nominal\r\nvariables and I have two issues:  </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1)<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">  \r\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">When the\r\nmodel runs with two ordinal variables (R3AQ573 and R3AQ575), the following\r\nerror message appear :</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:35.4pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Error in muthen1984(Data = X[[g]], ov.names = ov.names[[g]], ov.types =\r\nov.types,<span>  </span>: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:35.4pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>unknown ov.types:factor</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">I declare the variables as ‘ordered’.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&#39;data.frame&#39;:<span>   </span>2161 obs. of<span>  </span>61 variables:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>…</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>$ AQ573<span>           </span>: Ord.factor w/ 4 levels\r\n&quot;1&quot;&lt;&quot;2&quot;&lt;&quot;3&quot;&lt;&quot;4&quot;: 1 NA NA NA 1\r\n2 NA 1 NA 1 ...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span> </span>$ AQ575<span>           </span>: Ord.factor w/ 4 levels\r\n&quot;1&quot;&lt;&quot;2&quot;&lt;&quot;3&quot;&lt;&quot;4&quot;: 2 NA NA NA 4\r\n2 NA 1 NA 1 ...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">…</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Below my syntax:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">model_ord &lt;- &#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>#latent variables</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>PsyOrg =~ Part5cl_PCS_2Cl +\r\nR3FDP_SUMER + R3FSSSUP_SUMER + R3FSSCOL_SUMER</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Biomeca=~ R3BORGSUP15 +\r\nR3AQ573 + R3AQ575</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Epaule =~ R3SCRAVERE +\r\nR3EPAULESUP30 + R3EPAULE7EVA2</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                                         </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span># regressions</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Epaule ~ Biomeca + PsyOrg +\r\nR3AGE50 + R3OBES</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Biomeca ~ PsyOrg + R3AGE50</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>PsyOrg ~ R3AGE50</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                         </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>#residuals</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>R3FSSSUP_SUMER ~~\r\nR3FSSCOL_SUMER</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>fit_model_ord &lt;-\r\nsem(model_ord,data=SEM_hommes,estimator=&quot;WLSM&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">When the model runs with the two corresponding binary variables (R3SALTSA10\r\nand R3SALTSA13), there is no problem.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Below my syntax:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">model_bin &lt;- &#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:35.45pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">#latent variables</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>PsyOrg =~ Part5cl_PCS_2Cl +\r\nR3FDP_SUMER + R3FSSSUP_SUMER + R3FSSCOL_SUMER</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Biomeca=~ R3BORGSUP15 +\r\nR3SALTSA10 + R3SALTSA13</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Epaule =~ R3SCRAVERE +\r\nR3EPAULESUP30 + R3EPAULE7EVA2</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                                         </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span># regressions</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Epaule ~ Biomeca + PsyOrg +\r\nR3AGE50 + R3OBES</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>Biomeca ~ PsyOrg + R3AGE50</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>PsyOrg ~ R3AGE50</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                         </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>#residuals</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>R3FSSSUP_SUMER ~~\r\nR3FSSCOL_SUMER</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>         </span>fit_model_bin &lt;-\r\nsem(model_bin,data=SEM_hommes,estimator=&quot;WLSM&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:14.2pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Could</span><span><span lang=\"EN\"> you\r\ntell</span></span><span><span lang=\"EN\"> </span></span><span><span lang=\"EN\">me</span></span><span><span lang=\"EN\"> </span></span><span><span lang=\"EN\">where the problem is</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bot